	<key>NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription</key>
	<string>MM2 Values asks to save to Photos only when you tap Save Image while sharing, so a trade card or leaderboard card you built in the app is stored on your device — for example, saving your completed trade summary so you can post it to Discord later.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>MM2 Values opens your photo library only when you tap to add an image, so you can pick a photo or screenshot you already have — for example, choosing a saved picture as your profile photo, setting a group's icon, attaching a screenshot to a chat message, or uploading your artwork to the Designs feed.</string>
